:0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.4.1.stable.mono.official [49a5bc7b6] and v4.5.beta5.mono.official [c81fd6c51]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7680) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8700 CPU @ 3.20GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a child of an HBoxContainer is removed while the container is hidden and then re-added after showing the container it is positioned incorrectly. It should be noted that the container is anchored to the bottom center.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Run the minimal reproduction project\n- Press ui_right to show the container and add a button child. This looks correct\n- Press ui_left to hide the container and remove the child\n- Press ui_right again to show the container and add a button again. It now looks incorrect\n\nHow it looks when correct:\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e476d8b-af5f-464e-81d8-f7b798ae7c93\" />\n\nHow it looks when incorrect:\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9926423-3180-455a-89d6-4ccb0fba95f9\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[h-box-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21706633/h-box-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:/